1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:08,400
SHELDON:
Why hast thou forsaken me, O
deity whose existence I doubt?

2
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:12,740
(Policeman:)Here. Breathe
into this bag.

3
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,220
(Leonard:)What's going on?

4
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,890
They stole everything, Leonard!

5
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,330
(Sheldon:)Everything.

6
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,080
(Policeman:)Are you the roommate?

7
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:23,160
(Leonard:)Yeah, Leonard Hofstadter.
What happened?

8
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,400
(Policeman:)Your friend here called 911
to report a robbery.

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,330
(Leonard:)Oh, my God,
what did they get?

10
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,620
(Sheldon:)What didn't they get?

11
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,570
(Sheldon:)They got my enchanted weapons,

12
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,540
my vicious gladiator armor,

13
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,870
(Sheldon:)my wand of untainted power,

14
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,840
and all my gold!

15
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,650
(Leonard:)You called the police

16
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,420
(Leonard:)because someone hacked your
World of Warcraft account?

17
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,850
(Sheldon:)What choice did I have?

18
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,050
(Sheldon:)The mighty Sheldor,
level 85 blood elf,

19
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,860
(Sheldon:)hero of the Eastern kingdoms,

20
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:54,060
(Sheldon:)has been picked clean, like
a carcass in the desert sun.

21
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:56,930
(Sheldon:)Plus, the FBI hung up on me.

22
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,670
(wheezing)

23
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:01,020
(Policeman:)Into the bag.

